WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.080
Claims: claims for damage, loss and delay.

2
00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:10.220
From the shipment, click "Open claim" and write a short description.

3
00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:14.780
Review documents and photos and enter the "Approved amount".

4
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.070
Change the status and "Tell the customer".

5
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.840
The "Declared value" is the basis for compensation; ask for it when booking.
